# electronic states for the nonlinear-rotor test.  A ground state (degen 1)
# plus one excited state placed so high it is unpopulated at the test
# temperature, so the electronic partition function is ~1 and the rotor path
# is isolated (SPARTA requires at least two electronic states per species).
# id  nstate  (temp relax degen spin dof) x nstate
TRIA 2 0.0 0.01 1 1 0   500000.0 0.01 1 1 0
DIA  2 0.0 0.01 1 1 0   500000.0 0.01 1 1 0
ATO  2 0.0 0.01 1 1 0   500000.0 0.01 1 1 0
ATB  2 0.0 0.01 1 1 0   500000.0 0.01 1 1 0
